  <p id="c-liangshu-016-wangliang-family-clauses:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-liangshu-016-wangliang-family-clauses:p001:m0000" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAABDA">王亮</persName>字<persName id="c-liangshu-016-wangliang-family-clauses:p001:m0003" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAABDA">奉叔</persName>，琅邪臨沂人，晉丞相<persName id="c-liangshu-016-wangliang-family-clauses:p001:m0015" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAA">導</persName>之六世孫也。祖<persName id="c-liangshu-016-wangliang-family-clauses:p001:m0023" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAAB">偃</persName>，宋右光祿大夫、開府儀同三司。父<persName id="c-liangshu-016-wangliang-family-clauses:p001:m0040" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAABD">攸</persName>，給事黃門侍郎。</p>
